    {
      "name": "[03] Meus devices",
      "description": "Confere se o device da tomada independente está cadastrado para o usuário do environment.\n\nLogin (`POST /auth/login`, público) devolve `{token}`. `GET /api/v1/devices` exige o `x-api-key` criptografado E o Bearer JWT (`FetchUserDevicesController`), e devolve `[{id, serialNumber, nickname, city, notificables}]` do usuário logado.\n\nProcura `ALERT_TI_SERIAL` na lista e grava o `id` (UUID que trafega no MQTT) em `EVENTS_TI_DEVICE_ID`. Para persistir o UUID no arquivo de environment, rode com `--export-environment`.\n\nRequer `ALERT_USER_LOGIN` e `ALERT_USER_PASSWORD`; sem eles, os dois requests são pulados.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login do usuário do environment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Sem credencial no environment, o request é pulado (o smoke continua verde).",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('ALERT_USER_LOGIN') || !pm.environment.get('ALERT_USER_PASSWORD')) {",
                  "    console.log('ALERT_USER_LOGIN/ALERT_USER_PASSWORD vazios — pulando [03] Meus devices');",
                  "    pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Retorna token JWT', function () {",
                  "    var token = pm.response.json().token;",
                  "    pm.expect(token, 'resposta sem token').to.match(/^eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]+./);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ALERT_JWT', token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{ALERT_USER_LOGIN}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{ALERT_USER_PASSWORD}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Meus devices (procura ALERT_TI_SERIAL)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Sem credencial no environment, o request é pulado (o smoke continua verde).",
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('ALERT_USER_LOGIN') || !pm.environment.get('ALERT_USER_PASSWORD')) {",
                  "    console.log('ALERT_USER_LOGIN/ALERT_USER_PASSWORD vazios — pulando [03] Meus devices');",
                  "    pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var devices = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Resposta é array', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(devices).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Devices do usuário: ' + devices.map(function (d) { return d.serialNumber + ' -> ' + d.id; }).join(', '));",
                  "var serial = pm.environment.get('ALERT_TI_SERIAL');",
                  "var ti = devices.find(function (d) { return d.serialNumber === serial; });",
                  "pm.test('Serial ' + serial + ' cadastrado para o usuário', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(ti, 'serial ' + serial + ' não está na lista do usuário').to.exist;",
                  "});",
                  "if (ti) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('EVENTS_TI_DEVICE_ID', ti.id);",
                  "    console.log('EVENTS_TI_DEVICE_ID = ' + ti.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{ALERT_JWT}}", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{ALERT_API_KEY}}", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}/api/v1/devices",
              "host": ["{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "devices"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "[04] Login do agent (PVD develop)",
      "description": "Login que o PVD develop (5.02.03, AUTH_STRATEGY=modern) faz ao entrar no Alerta24h: POST /auth/agent/login com usuário, senha e serial do nobreak (ModernAuthStrategy.java). Rota pública, sem x-api-key (SecurityConfiguration: /auth/** permitAll; o ApiKeyFilter só cobre /api/v1/*).\n\nDevolve {token, deviceId}. O deviceId é o UUID que o PVD usa nos tópicos MQTT a24h/{deviceId}/... Se ALERT_TI_SERIAL não estiver associado ao usuário, o alert-service responde 400 (DeviceNotAuthorizedException).\n\nGrava ALERT_AGENT_JWT e ALERT_AGENT_DEVICE_ID. Requer ALERT_USER_LOGIN e ALERT_USER_PASSWORD; sem eles, a pasta é pulada.",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Sem credencial no environment, o request é pulado.",
              "if (!pm.environment.get('ALERT_USER_LOGIN') || !pm.environment.get('ALERT_USER_PASSWORD')) {",
              "    console.log('ALERT_USER_LOGIN/ALERT_USER_PASSWORD vazios, pulando [04] Login do agent');",
              "    pm.execution.skipRequest();",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login do agent com o serial do environment",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var b = {};",
                  "try { b = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) {}",
                  "pm.test('Retorna token JWT', function () { pm.expect(b.token, 'resposta sem token').to.match(/^eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]+./); });",
                  "pm.test('Retorna deviceId (UUID)', function () { pm.expect(b.deviceId).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i); });",
                  "if (b.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('ALERT_AGENT_JWT', b.token); }",
                  "if (b.deviceId) { pm.collectionVariables.set('ALERT_AGENT_DEVICE_ID', b.deviceId); console.log('deviceId do serial ' + pm.environment.get('ALERT_TI_SERIAL') + ' = ' + b.deviceId + ' (topicos MQTT a24h/' + b.deviceId + '/...)'); }",
                  "var esperado = pm.environment.get('EVENTS_TI_DEVICE_ID');",
                  "if (esperado && b.deviceId) {",
                  "    pm.test('deviceId igual ao de [03] Meus devices', function () { pm.expect(b.deviceId).to.eql(esperado); });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{ALERT_USER_LOGIN}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{ALERT_USER_PASSWORD}}\",\n  \"serialNumber\": \"{{ALERT_TI_SERIAL}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}/auth/agent/login",
              "host": ["{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "agent", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Serial não associado ao usuário → 400",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(400); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{ALERT_USER_LOGIN}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{ALERT_USER_PASSWORD}}\",\n  \"serialNumber\": \"000000000000\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}/auth/agent/login",
              "host": ["{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "agent", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Senha errada → 4xx",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 4xx', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(400, 499); });",
                  "console.log('Senha errada no login do agent: HTTP ' + pm.response.code);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{ALERT_USER_LOGIN}}\",\n  \"password\": \"bbd-tests-senha-errada\",\n  \"serialNumber\": \"{{ALERT_TI_SERIAL}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}/auth/agent/login",
              "host": ["{{ALERT_BASE_URL}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "agent", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
